.551">outside </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.551" end="00:47.231"><span begin="00:43.551" end="00:43.801">Don't </span><span begin="00:43.801" end="00:43.981">come </span><span begin="00:43.981" end="00:45.171">in </span><span begin="00:45.171" end="00:45.481">- </span><span begin="00:45.481" end="00:45.981">I'll </span><span begin="00:45.981" end="00:46.291">only </span><span begin="00:46.291" end="00:46.541">run </span><span begin="00:46.541" end="00:46.981">and </span><span begin="00:46.981" end="00:47.231">hide </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.231" end="00:48.791"><span begin="00:47.231" end="00:47.731">Who </span><span begin="00:47.731" end="00:47.981">can </span><span begin="00:47.981" end="00:48.291">it </span><span begin="00:48.291" end="00:48.481">be </span><span begin="00:48.481" end="00:51.751">now </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.751" end="00:54.561"><span begin="00:51.751" end="00:52.131">Who </span><span begin="00:52.131" end="00:52.321">can </span><span begin="00:52.321" end="00:53.131">it </span><span begin="00:53.131" end="00:53.311">be </span><span begin="00:53.311" end="00:54.561">now </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.561" end="00:58.121"><span begin="00:54.561" end="00:54.811">Who </span><span begin="00:54.811" end="00:55.001">can </span><span begin="00:55.001" end="00:55.251">it </span><span begin="00:55.251" end="00:55.751">be </span><span begin="00:55.751" end="00:58.121">now </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.121" end="01:02.301"><span begin="00:58.121" end="00:58.371">Who </span><span begin="00:58.371" end="00:58.561">can </span><span begin="00:58.561" end="00:58.811">it </span><span begin="00:58.811" end="00:59.431">be </span><span begin="00:59.431" end="01:02.301">now </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.301" end="01:05.861"><span begin="01:02.301" end="01:02.741">Who </span><span begin="01:02.741" end="01:02.921">can </span><span begin="01:02.921" end="01:03.171">it </span><span begin="01:0